   {
    "ja": "銀の麦畑"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Silver Wheat Field"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "The \"Golden Wizard\" is the hero who saved a kingdom, and the \"Silver Wizard\" is the wicked mage who killed the king.\nOne day, May, a baker's daughter living in the country where the legend of the two wizards was born, finds a grain of wheat in shining silver on the outskirts of town. What awaits her is a \"silver wheat field\" covered in shimmering stalks of silver wheat. This is a silvery fantasy woven by wizards.\n\n(Source: GFantasy, translated)\n\n---\nNote: Originally a one-shot story published in GFantasy, it was picked up for full serialization by the magazine starting 2023-02-18."
  },
